      "value": "Thanks for the suggestion! \nNow that we've implemented VRAM metrics for avatars, our next step is to add in some new performance settings like this.\nWe'll want to make sure we get it right, so it's easy to understand for most users (and it works as intended). We'll give it some design attention, and hopefully get it out some time after release. I don't have a precise ETA yet, though.",
