      "value": "@{632a1f5ab98aa644af84dab3|full_name}: I actually just realized that you posted this nearly 14 months ago.\n\nCan you guys stop promising things that never happen? How hard is it to literally just put in an input field in the settings and then `if (textureMemory > setting) blockAvatar();` I know people say that as a joke, but this unironically shouldn't be that hard, no?\n\nLike, you already have the system in place. Is it not modular enough that this sort of system couldn't be implemented in an afternoon, and released within a week?",
